'''Kutral''' is an [[NPC]] in the {{zone|Dragontail}} brewery that talks to {{NPCSprite|Nall}} about new [[Abiphone]]s. 

== Keypad Code ==
By standing at {{Coords|-655|107|-741}}, the player can overhear '''Kutral''' and [[Nall]]'s conversation, which includes a 4-digit code. The code can be entered at the Keypad located at {{Coords|-678|107|-736}}, to access the secret room in which {{NPCSprite|Nuvian}} sells [[Abiphone]]s. The code changes every day.

